# Normalise to LF in the repository; Git checks out native line endings on
# Windows.  Without this a Windows-authored file lands in the repo with CRLF and
# every later diff from a Linux machine rewrites the whole file.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.dxf text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
